# Tenant credentials. `@c8y/devkit:deploy` reads url/user/password from here
# (dotenv, C8Y_-prefixed), which is the convenient way to deploy and exactly
# the file that must never reach a remote.
.env

# The Sales Configurator workbook is the internal price list. It is the
# reference this tool maps onto, never something the tool ships or publishes:
# the app, the generated workbook and the docs carry volumes only. Keep it out
# of the repository entirely -- history is forever.
*.xlsx
